OL,3,ATrafalgar Square Christmas tree felled 
OL,4,Ain Norway                              
OL,6,FThis year's Trafalgar Square Christmas 
OL,7,Ftree has been cut down in a forest     
OL,8,Foutside Oslo, ready to begin its       
OL,9,Fjourney to London.                     
OL,11,FThe 21m (69ft) tree, nicknamed Jolly   
OL,12,FCheery, is about 75 years old. It was  
OL,13,Ffelled on Friday by the Lord Mayor of  
OL,14,FWestminster, Karen Scarborough, and the
OL,15,FMayor of Oslo, Anne Lindboe.           
OL,17,FNorway has sent a tree to the capital  
OL,18,Fevery year since 1947 as a thank you   
OL,19,Ffor Britain's support during World War 
OL,20,FTwo, when King Haakon VII and the      
OL,21,FNorwegian government lived in exile in 
OL,22,FLondon.                                
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
