OL,3,ATrafalgar Square Christmas tree felled 
OL,4,Ain Norway                              
OL,6,FIts lights will be switched on by the  
OL,7,Ftwo mayors at a ceremony in the square 
OL,8,Fon Thursday, 3 December.               
